<title>TUNISIA: PRESS DIGEST - Tunisia - Oct 1.</title>
<headline>PRESS DIGEST - Tunisia - Oct 1.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>These are the leading stories in the Tunisian press on Tuesday. Reuters has not verified these stories and does not vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>LA PRESSE</p>
<p>- President Ben Ali signs legislation allowing health insurance for the elderly.</p>
<p>- President Ben Ali received on Monday BIAT's bank chairman Mokhtar Fakhfakh and stresses the bank's role in helping firms modernise.</p>
<p>LE TEMPS</p>
<p>- Mystery over missing Tunisian student in Greece, believed kidnapped a year ago. An Israeli among the suspects.</p>
